skill_gaps_summary: "The candidate faces several critical gaps that make them unsuitable for a senior position. The most significant is the experience gap (2 years vs required 7+), which cannot be bridged in the short term. There's also a complete absence of FastAPI ecosystem experience and limited backend development expertise, particularly in databases. While some technical gaps could be learned, the combination of missing senior-level experience and core technical requirements makes this candidate not suitable for this role."
strengths[5]: Strong CI/CD experience,Solid Git version control skills,Linux/Unix systems knowledge,Python programming capability,Infrastructure experience
strengths_reason: "The candidate shows solid foundational technical skills particularly in infrastructure and development tools. Their experience with CI/CD, Git, and Linux systems demonstrates good DevOps knowledge. While their Python experience is entry-level, it shows technical learning capability."
