detailed_feedback: "The candidate shows promise in infrastructure and development tools, with good experience in CI/CD pipelines, Git version control, and Linux systems. Their Python experience, while present, is primarily from research rather than production backend development.\n\nHowever, there are significant gaps that make them unsuitable for this senior position. With only 2 years of experience versus the required 7+, they lack the depth of experience necessary for a senior role. They have no experience with the FastAPI ecosystem (FastAPI, Starlette, Pydantic) which is crucial for this position. Their GitHub profile, while active, doesn't demonstrate relevant backend development projects.\n\nThe combination of insufficient experience and missing core technical requirements suggests this candidate would be better suited for a junior or mid-level backend position where they can develop these missing skills."
